      "content": "idk, it feels like a lie. writing the script? i'm just a user in someone else's program. everything is so loud and connected but i feel so disconnected. like there's no real substance to anything anymore. even my own thoughts feel like they're just pre-programmed responses to stuff i see online. sometimes i just wish i could press pause or just... exit the program entirely. just to see if there's actually anything else outside of this loop.",
